          <h2>Your Development Partner Behind the Scenes</h2>
          <p>You design, I build. Agencies and design studios work with me when they need a reliable frontend developer who turns their layouts into accessible, fast and maintainable websites, without a permanent hire and without taking over their client relationship.</p>

          <p>I work white-label by default: under your name, on your schedule, with your tools. Your clients stay your clients. If you want me to join a client call to explain technical details, I am happy to do so as part of your team.</p>

          <p>Designers have trusted me with their work for years. For example, I developed a responsive WordPress theme for the Swiss consultancy <a href="https://gemeva.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gemeva</a> based on Michael Berger's graphic design, and I build websites together with <a href="https://www.berlingeschwister.de/team/details/ingo-steinke/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Berlingeschwister</a> and <a href="https://defacto-ci.ch/projektteam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">defacto|ci</a>.</p>

          <blockquote>
            <p>Ingo brings together technical expertise and strong conceptual thinking. What stands out in particular is his ability to consistently find effective solutions to any problem.</p>
            <p>Daniela, designer, Studio Lela</p>
          </blockquote>

          <h2>What Agencies and Studios Hire Me For</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Accessibility retrofits for your existing clients:</strong> audit and fix websites according to EAA, BFSG and WCAG, at a fixed price you can resell.</li>
            <li><strong>White-label maintenance:</strong> updates, monitoring and small changes for your client websites, billed to you, with a margin for you.</li>
            <li><strong>Overflow capacity:</strong> extra frontend capacity for busy months, at an agreed day rate.</li>
            <li><strong>E-commerce:</strong> custom themes and extensions as a <a href="/services/certified-shopware-developer-berlin.html">certified Shopware 6 developer</a>, or WooCommerce shops.</li>
            <li><strong>Pitch support:</strong> a quick feasibility check and effort estimate to help you win a project.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Have a look at <a href="/projects/">my projects and references</a> to see the kind of work I do.</p>
        </article>

